        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The assigned posts listed below shall be held for a maximum period of two (2) years, at which time the incumbent must return to a bid assignment. In the event of circumstances beyond the control of the institution, management may temporarily hold an employee in one (1) of these assignments not to exceed an additional six (6) months.",
